  "name": "Leg Exit",
  "description": "On the one-minute BTC up/down: with more than 15 seconds left and nothing resting, when the ask on up sits at least 4 cents under fair, rest a bid one cent under fair spending half the round budget. If it fills, hold until the bid on up is 5 cents above what the hunting leg paid, or cut the loss when the bid drops 10 cents under the average entry; either way sell the whole position at market. Pull an unfilled bid with 10 seconds left.",
